[I] X Inter-Client Exchange (ICE) protocol library

[T] libICE implements the X Inter-Client Exchange protocol, a generic
[T] framework for building protocols on top of reliable byte streams. It is
[T] mainly used by the X Session Management protocol (libSM).

[U] https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xorg/lib/libice

[A] X.org Foundation {http://www.X.org}
